        "created_at": "2013-08-29T17:55:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I see that &gt;G is going to be at Grand Con, and I also see it wasn't listed in the post about volunteering.</p><p>Grand Rapids is near where I grew up, and I would love to go and volunteer if possible. &nbsp;Just wondering what the status of the Grand Con is, if any help is needed, or is it a small showing?</p><p>Also will there be any demoing of Tactics there? &nbsp;I really just want to know if it is worth the effort to go, I like the con itself, but I'd probably skip it this year unless I have a good reason to go (like playing Tactics or being able to volunteer)</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:09.190Z",
