        "raw": "<p>I see that &gt;G is going to be at Grand Con, and I also see it wasn&#39;t listed in the post about volunteering.</p><p>Grand Rapids is near where I grew up, and I would love to go and volunteer if possible. &nbsp;Just wondering what the status of the Grand Con is, if any help is needed, or is it a small showing?</p><p>Also will there be any demoing of Tactics there? &nbsp;I really just want to know if it is worth the effort to go, I like the con itself, but I&#39;d probably skip it this year unless I have a good reason to go (like playing Tactics or being able to volunteer)</p>",
